    "detailed_description": "Farm Station it is a game where we play the role of the eccentric owner of Farm Station.<br>Our daily duties include taking care of providing supplies for the store, customer service and also repairing their machines.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310070/extras/4d52be7d34ed4b7012002872f4ef983d.poster.avif?t=1725038408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310070/extras/4d52be7d34ed4b7012002872f4ef983d.webm?t=1725038408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>A good job pays off in popularity among customers!<br>The functioning of Farm Station depends on your decisions!<br>It is your decision how you will treat the customers, whether you want to be nice and fair with customers, or on the contrary, rough and surly!<br>The game has a pet manager system. They help you with everything! Don\u2019t forget to take care of bond with them, then pets will be more helpful.<br>The action of the game is in the late 1970s. You will feel this atmosphere through the reproducing of the realities of that time. Starting from the realistic work of the cash register, and fuel distributor to huge agricultural machines.",
    "about_the_game": "Farm Station it is a game where we play the role of the eccentric owner of Farm Station.<br>Our daily duties include taking care of providing supplies for the store, customer service and also repairing their machines.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310070/extras/4d52be7d34ed4b7012002872f4ef983d.poster.avif?t=1725038408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310070/extras/4d52be7d34ed4b7012002872f4ef983d.webm?t=1725038408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>A good job pays off in popularity among customers!<br>The functioning of Farm Station depends on your decisions!<br>It is your decision how you will treat the customers, whether you want to be nice and fair with customers, or on the contrary, rough and surly!<br>The game has a pet manager system. They help you with everything! Don\u2019t forget to take care of bond with them, then pets will be more helpful.<br>The action of the game is in the late 1970s. You will feel this atmosphere through the reproducing of the realities of that time. Starting from the realistic work of the cash register, and fuel distributor to huge agricultural machines.",
